<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<Flow xmlns="http://soap.sforce.com/2006/04/metadata">
    <apiVersion>56.0</apiVersion>
    <areMetricsLoggedToDataCloud>false</areMetricsLoggedToDataCloud>
    <description>2024-08-21: Send the api name of flow to subflow instead of label. 
2024-03-21: Inserts a debugLog__c record when SyncWithMc__c is changed
2023-11-22: Moved logic to subflow so that it can be reused for more than the trigger scenario
2023-11-20.2: Now all updates has their own error handler in order to be able to continue processing other child objects if one fails.
2023-11-20: Same logic as with prev update but it is based on the child object formula field instead of in the GET
2023-11-19: Only updating child records with correct statuses.
2023-11-09: Updated log message on success. Ps - tested and saw bug is fixed.
2023-11-09: Buggy behavior seems to be fixed
Recreated all pinks in hope to resolve some sf buggy behaviour
Fixed mapping errors
Now logging on errors to avoid spamming with too many error emails. + being able to take reports.</description>
    <environments>Default</environments>
    <formulas>
        <name>formula_logText</name>
        <dataType>String</dataType>
        <expression>&quot;SyncWithMc__c was updated to: &quot; &amp;  IF($Record.SyncWithMc__c, &quot;true&quot;,&quot;false&quot;)</expression>
    </formulas>
    <interviewLabel>Account - TRG - Sync With Mc Is Changed {!$Flow.CurrentDateTime}</interviewLabel>
    <label>Account - TRG - Sync With Mc Is Changed</label>
    <processMetadataValues>
        <name>BuilderType</name>
        <value>
            <stringValue>LightningFlowBuilder</stringValue>
        </value>
    </processMetadataValues>
    <processMetadataValues>
        <name>CanvasMode</name>
        <value>
            <stringValue>AUTO_LAYOUT_CANVAS</stringValue>
        </value>
    </processMetadataValues>
    <processMetadataValues>
        <name>OriginBuilderType</name>
        <value>
            <stringValue>LightningFlowBuilder</stringValue>
        </value>
    </processMetadataValues>
    <processType>AutoLaunchedFlow</processType>
    <recordCreates>
        <name>CreateDebugLog</name>
        <label>Create Debug Log</label>
        <locationX>176</locationX>
        <locationY>323</locationY>
        <connector>
            <targetReference>Set_MC_sync_on_child_records</targetReference>
        </connector>
        <inputAssignments>
            <field>Account__c</field>
            <value>
                <elementReference>$Record.Id</elementReference>
            </value>
        </inputAssignments>
        <inputAssignments>
            <field>Flow_Name__c</field>
            <value>
                <stringValue>Account_TRG_SyncWithMcIsChanged</stringValue>
            </value>
        </inputAssignments>
        <inputAssignments>
            <field>Flow_log__c</field>
            <value>
                <booleanValue>true</booleanValue>
            </value>
        </inputAssignments>
        <inputAssignments>
            <field>Input__c</field>
            <value>
                <elementReference>$Record.SyncWithMc__c</elementReference>
            </value>
        </inputAssignments>
        <inputAssignments>
            <field>Message__c</field>
            <value>
                <elementReference>formula_logText</elementReference>
            </value>
        </inputAssignments>
        <inputAssignments>
            <field>RecordId__c</field>
            <value>
                <elementReference>$Record.Id</elementReference>
            </value>
        </inputAssignments>
        <inputAssignments>
            <field>Type__c</field>
            <value>
                <stringValue>Information</stringValue>
            </value>
        </inputAssignments>
        <object>DebugLog__c</object>
        <storeOutputAutomatically>true</storeOutputAutomatically>
    </recordCreates>
    <start>
        <locationX>50</locationX>
        <locationY>0</locationY>
        <connector>
            <targetReference>CreateDebugLog</targetReference>
        </connector>
        <filterLogic>and</filterLogic>
        <filters>
            <field>SyncWithMc__c</field>
            <operator>IsChanged</operator>
            <value>
                <booleanValue>true</booleanValue>
            </value>
        </filters>
        <object>Account</object>
        <recordTriggerType>Update</recordTriggerType>
        <triggerType>RecordAfterSave</triggerType>
    </start>
    <status>Active</status>
    <subflows>
        <name>Set_MC_sync_on_child_records</name>
        <label>Set MC sync on child records</label>
        <locationX>176</locationX>
        <locationY>431</locationY>
        <flowName>Account_SUB_SetMcSyncStatusOnChildRecords</flowName>
        <inputAssignments>
            <name>txt_parentFlowName</name>
            <value>
                <stringValue>Account_TRG_SyncWithMcIsChanged</stringValue>
            </value>
        </inputAssignments>
        <inputAssignments>
            <name>var_sObj_inputAccount</name>
            <value>
                <elementReference>$Record</elementReference>
            </value>
        </inputAssignments>
    </subflows>
</Flow>
